Late! Late! Late!

23
00:01:44,260 --> 00:01:46,260
It's time for the daily morning news.

24
00:01:46,260 --> 00:01:48,260
Last night, two residents of this town

25
00:01:48,260 --> 00:01:50,260
Mysteriously, its voice vanished.

26
00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:53,260
Apparently, the town doctors have no clue about this strange illness.

27
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:56,260
So far they can't figure out the cause or treatment.

28
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:58,260
Losing one's voice overnight is truly baffling.

29
00:01:58,260 --> 00:01:59,260
These two residents, before losing their voices,

30
