31
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:05,260
Could it be that seeing Miss MU in person made them so excited they lost their voices?

32
00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:09,259
I can only wish them good luck.

33
00:02:09,259 --> 00:02:11,259
This is Tuna Town Morning News.

34
00:02:11,259 --> 00:02:13,259
We'll be right back after these ads.

35
00:02:21,259 --> 00:02:23,259
Uh-oh~

36
00:02:23,259 --> 00:02:26,259
Hello everyone!

37
00:02:26,259 --> 00:02:29,259
This is Treasure Match, the special Sunday program.

38
00:02:29,259 --> 00:02:32,259
I'm the lovable Miss MU.

39
00:02:32,259 --> 00:02:34,259
Miss MU, we're off to school!

40
00:02:34,259 --> 00:02:35,259
Goodbye!

41
00:02:49,259 --> 00:02:51,259
Late, late, late!

42
00:02:53,259 --> 00:02:56,259
Is that person here to hire Uncle for a case?

43
00:02:56,259 --> 00:03:00,259
De- De- Detective Chen?

44
00:03:06,259 --> 00:03:07,259
So,

45
00:03:07,259 --> 00:03:09,259
What can I do for you?

46
00:03:15,259 --> 00:03:16,259
Three days ago,

47
00:03:16,259 --> 00:03:19,259
After taking part in the recording of Treasure Match,

48
00:03:19,259 --> 00:03:21,259
my most precious treasure, the fish basin,

49
00:03:21,259 --> 00:03:24,099
that fish basin was mysteriously stolen.

50
00:03:24,099 --> 00:03:27,379
Later, I received a call from the thief.

51
00:03:27,379 --> 00:03:29,759
Let me go to the outskirts this morning

52
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:31,799
to the Misty Bamboo Grove to retrieve it

53
00:03:31,799 --> 00:03:34,879
Why not notify the police?

54
00:03:34,879 --> 00:03:38,620
The fish bowl is too precious to me

55
00:03:38,620 --> 00:03:41,180
I must ensure it's unharmed

56
00:03:41,180 --> 00:03:43,879
If the gang finds out

57
00:03:43,879 --> 00:03:45,439
I notified the police...

58
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:49,159
So I'd like to ask for your help

59
00:03:49,159 --> 00:03:52,620
Understood

60
00:03:52,620 --> 00:03:53,400
I'll help you

61
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,579
Really?

62
00:03:54,579 --> 00:03:56,079
Great

63
00:03:56,079 --> 00:03:57,659
What's the commission fee?

64
00:03:57,659 --> 00:03:58,560
That's not urgent

65
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:01,340
Misty Bamboo Grove

66
00:04:01,340 --> 00:04:02,960
I need some equipment

67
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,479
Aren't you going to class?

68
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:33,479
[Misty Bamboo Grove, Morning]

69
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,759
The meeting time is almost here

70
00:04:45,759 --> 00:04:46,920
Steady

71
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:50,939
Report!

72
00:04:50,939 --> 00:04:54,439
Reporting to Officer Han

73
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:56,900
Thermal cameras from all angles are installed

74
00:04:56,900 --> 00:05:00,480
Thank you both for lending me this high-end equipment

75
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:04,980
Fighting criminals is what the police should do

76
00:05:04,980 --> 00:05:07,480
But I have a small request

77
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,080
I hope you can grant it

78
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:11,740
Shh, time is almost up

79
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:19,400
I'm suffocating

80
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,180
Looks like to be a detective

81
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:21,400
You need superhuman endurance

82
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:31,759
Hey! Anyone there?

83
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:36,259
I've arrived at the agreed spot

84
00:05:36,259 --> 00:05:37,480
Mr. Robber

85
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,800
Where are you?

86
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,840
I've brought the money you asked for

87
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:43,439
Can you return my precious fish basin to me?

88
00:05:43,439 --> 00:05:44,639
Please, I beg you

89
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:46,000
You can take whatever you want

90
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,000
My fishing rod

91
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,779
My fishing boat

92
00:05:47,779 --> 00:05:49,860
And my little fish hat

93
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:51,839
I'll give you all of them

94
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:53,660
I only beg you

95
00:05:53,660 --> 00:05:58,120
Please give back my precious fish basin

96
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:03,180
Haha, you want the fish basin?

97
00:06:03,180 --> 00:06:08,639
Found them

98
00:06:08,639 --> 00:06:09,860
It's two people

99
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:18,580
Dare to call the cops

100
00:06:18,580 --> 00:06:20,480
Over there

101
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,879
On the bamboo behind the fisherman

102
00:06:21,879 --> 00:06:26,939
Stop right there!

103
00:06:26,939 --> 00:06:28,680
Or I'll shoot.

104
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:33,360
Catch me if you can!

105
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:37,439
Escape? Did he get away?

106
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,180
How dare he!

107
00:06:38,180 --> 00:06:54,899
I've decided to forbid you from now on

108
00:06:54,899 --> 00:06:56,180
from intervening in all case investigations.

109
00:06:56,180 --> 00:06:58,060
Uncle Sima, don't be so heartless.

110
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:00,439
Jingjing,

111
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:02,920
from now on you will watch Locky Qi

112
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:03,680
step by step.

113
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:05,680
Make sure he goes to and from school on time every day,

114
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,139
and never again let him join case investigations.

115
00:07:07,139 --> 00:07:07,680
Yes.

116
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:12,019
But Jingjing likes solving cases with Locky.

117
00:07:12,019 --> 00:07:13,180
Jingjing!

118
00:07:13,180 --> 00:07:16,180
You're finally on my side.

119
00:07:16,180 --> 00:07:22,360
Double the daily juice supply,

120
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:25,280
plus the latest Miss MU poster.

121
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:27,519
Reporting to Uncle Sima!

122
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:29,780
I'll definitely keep a tight watch on Locky!

123
00:07:29,780 --> 00:07:30,740
Traitor!

124
00:07:30,740 --> 00:07:40,340
Rolling around, rolling around, tired of rolling.

125
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:44,139
Uncle Sima doesn't even know where to go investigate cases.

126
00:07:44,139 --> 00:07:47,759
What case did that fisherman ask Uncle about?

127
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:51,420
At the time, I think I saw him hand Uncle a photo.

128
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:54,840
What was the picture on that photo?

129
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:59,680
Too bad I messed everything up.

130
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:02,680
Uncle won't let me join the investigation anymore.

131
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:07,680
Uncle must have locked that photo in the secret room.

132
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,680
I really want to go in and see it.

133
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:12,680
But Uncle always keeps the key to the secret room on him.

134
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:15,680
And now he assigned a little guard to watch me day and night.

135
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:27,680
Uncle actually gave her the key instead of me.

136
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:30,680
I'm his own nephew!

137
00:08:40,680 --> 00:08:43,680
Jingjing, what are you doing?

138
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:47,680
Watching TV.

139
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:49,680
Uncle told you not to run around.

140
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:51,680
No, I won't run around.

141
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:54,680
I just wanted to ask if you want to watch Miss MU's show.

142
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:58,300
Yes, yes, yes! I don't understand that show at all.

143
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:03,040
I see. I saw you were bored downstairs, so I came specifically to tell you.

144
00:09:03,620 --> 00:09:12,520
I know there's a VHS tape at home. The content is a TV show from a few days ago, hosted by Miss MU, called Treasure Match.

145
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:15,080
I wonder if you'd like to watch it?

146
00:09:16,540 --> 00:09:17,860
Wow, yes, I want to!

147
00:09:17,860 --> 00:09:21,779
But that tape was recorded by Uncle.

148
00:09:21,779 --> 00:09:24,860
You know Uncle is very stingy.

149
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:28,580
He locks all the tapes in his own secret room.

150
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:30,779
I don't have the key.

151
00:09:30,779 --> 00:09:32,980
I really can't take it out to show you

152
00:09:32,980 --> 00:09:36,019
Such a pity

153
00:09:36,019 --> 00:09:38,320
The show was truly wonderful

154
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,879
I have the key

155
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:54,940
It's really not like being lonely and alone

156
00:09:54,940 --> 00:10:02,879
At times in life, there's inevitably some unhappiness

157
00:10:02,879 --> 00:10:10,379
Bidding farewell to today always leaves one feeling lost

158
00:10:10,379 --> 00:10:18,200
Look at tomorrow—it's waving to me on the horizon

159
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:25,840
Every day, as the sun rises and sets, time turns, and I dream more

160
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:30,899
Looking forward to every second, every moment in life

161
00:10:30,899 --> 00:10:37,620
My bright eyes are sparkling

162
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:40,980
A smile facing the sunlight

163
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:46,220
Stepping quietly at the crossroads where screams echo